{
  "company_name": "DistroForecast Systems",
  "industry": "Industrial Distribution",
  "use_case": "Industrial product demand forecasting and order backlog management",
  "space_title": "DistroForecast Systems - Demand Forecasting & Backlog 📈",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Industrial Distribution\n\n**Use case:** Demand Forecasting & Backlog Management\n\nDistroForecast Systems — demand planning analytics across 20 industrial SKUs spanning fasteners, bearings, valves, electrical, and safety. Category Managers and Supply Planners use this space to monitor forecast accuracy and backlog day-to-day; Branch Managers and the CFO use it to track open-order revenue, fill rate, and the working-capital tied up in backorders.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Forecast accuracy / MAPE (%) — best-in-class industrial distributors run 10-20% MAPE\n- Fill rate (%) — line/case-fill target ≥97% for MRO distribution\n- Order backlog units and open-order value ($) — working-capital and revenue-at-risk signal\n- Backorder rate (%) — lost-sales and customer-churn leading indicator\n- Lead time (days) — commitment vs. actual time-to-ship\n- Forecast bias (units) — systematic over/under-forecasting by category\n- Customer satisfaction score (1-5) — service-level outcome\n- Days-to-ship — fulfillment cycle metric\n\n**Data sources**\n- `product_skus` — daily sales orders with quantity, price, lead time, status\n- `sales_orders` — weekly pipeline snapshot: open-order value, fill rate, backorders, satisfaction\n- `demand_forecasts` — monthly forecast vs. actual with MAPE and confidence intervals by SKU",
  "schema_basename": "distro_demand_forecast",
  "tables": [
